French Defence ... A few minutes afterwards Cambridge got a second victory on
Board 6. The play in this game is called by a contemporary very erratic. It
was certainly far below the standard exhibited on any other board. The two
combatants could not engage in a second game in consequence of their first
being terminated after 5.} 0-1

